{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/header1__5_.png?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/trinkets-combat.gif?t=1749113212\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hand plays according to the standard rules of blackjack, but every hit, stand, or double down matters and creates a series of triggers that helps you beat the odds. Pick your starting suits to fit your playstyle, as each comes with its own perks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spades cards will grant you additional damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hearts cards will recover health during battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clubs cards will increase your luck, helping your to get more favorables draws </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diamonds cards will steal chips from your opponent, allowing you to purchase new cards and trinkets<strong>\u00a0</strong>for the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/Group_4397__1_.png?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/shop1-gif.gif?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your journey with endless possibilities. Fine-tune your deck to suit your unique playstyle and craft synergies that defy the odds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ Starting decks to unlock, each shaping your gameplay from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your 2 starting suits, with the ability to purchase additional cards of any suits during your run to further customize your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ trinkets to discover, acquired as battle rewards, during events, or purchased at the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 different card upgrade effects to empower your cards and gain a decisive edge during battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/header3__2_.png?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/map-gif.gif?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a labyrinth of ever-changing casinos. Each map is procedurally generated, packed with secret events, dealers with rigged decks, and unpredictable challenges. No two runs are the same, ensuring endless replayability and strategic depth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 difficulty levels, adding an extra layer of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ unique events that will alter your run in different ways depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different maps, featuring different pit-bosses at the end of each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Opponent's decks and trinkets are randomly generated at the beggining of each run. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446840?t=1749113212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446840?t=1749113212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/06c103136b3018dd5f80b9092a336645a9e66907/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749113212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/06c103136b3018dd5f80b9092a336645a9e66907/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749113212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3456330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/header1__5_.png?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/trinkets-combat.gif?t=1749113212\" /><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each hand plays according to the standard rules of blackjack, but every hit, stand, or double down matters and creates a series of triggers that helps you beat the odds. Pick your starting suits to fit your playstyle, as each comes with its own perks:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spades cards will grant you additional damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hearts cards will recover health during battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clubs cards will increase your luck, helping your to get more favorables draws </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Diamonds cards will steal chips from your opponent, allowing you to purchase new cards and trinkets<strong>\u00a0</strong>for the run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/Group_4397__1_.png?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/shop1-gif.gif?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your journey with endless possibilities. Fine-tune your deck to suit your unique playstyle and craft synergies that defy the odds:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ Starting decks to unlock, each shaping your gameplay from the start.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your 2 starting suits, with the ability to purchase additional cards of any suits during your run to further customize your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ trinkets to discover, acquired as battle rewards, during events, or purchased at the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 different card upgrade effects to empower your cards and gain a decisive edge during battle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/header3__2_.png?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446840/extras/map-gif.gif?t=1749113212\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture through a labyrinth of ever-changing casinos. Each map is procedurally generated, packed with secret events, dealers with rigged decks, and unpredictable challenges. No two runs are the same, ensuring endless replayability and strategic depth:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 difficulty levels, adding an extra layer of challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ unique events that will alter your run in different ways depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 different maps, featuring different pit-bosses at the end of each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Opponent's decks and trinkets are randomly generated at the beggining of each run. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Zandbox Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descripti